    },
    {
      "displayText": "You want to know what I’m doing? Well, I’m\nfeeding these wild Aron!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F0020006B006E006F007700200077006800610074002000492019006D00200064006F0069006E0067003F002000570065006C006C002C002000492019006D000A00660065006500640069006E0067002000740068006500730065002000770069006C0064002000410072006F006E0021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aron love to eat metal—they’ll even munch away\nat cars and things if you’re not careful.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I feed them scrap metal to make sure they\ndon’t start eating what they shouldn’t.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I do worry they’ll get bored if I keep feeding them\nthe same old thing all the time, though.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And so I had an idea!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200073006F00200049002000680061006400200061006E002000690064006500610021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t you think a Poison-type move would add\nsome really nice flavor to scrap metal?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Steel-type Pokémon can’t be poisoned, so it won’t\nbother them at all!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400650065006C002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000630061006E2019007400200062006500200070006F00690073006F006E00650064002C00200073006F00200069007400200077006F006E20190074000A0062006F00740068006500720020007400680065006D00200061007400200061006C006C0021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’re happy to help me test my idea, hit that\npile of scrap metal with the move <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Sludge Bomb<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto give it some seasoning, please!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
