      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oooh! That Sludge Bomb gave the scrap metal\nsuch a tantalizing aroma!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006F006F006800210020005400680061007400200053006C007500640067006500200042006F006D00620020006700610076006500200074006800650020007300630072006100700020006D006500740061006C000A007300750063006800200061002000740061006E00740061006C0069007A0069006E0067002000610072006F006D00610021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gryaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072007900610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And look! The Aron seem pretty happy with the\nresult, too. They’re chowing down!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m so glad this random idea of mine worked out.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200073006F00200067006C0061006400200074006800690073002000720061006E0064006F006D002000690064006500610020006F00660020006D0069006E006500200077006F0072006B006500640020006F00750074002E001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for spicing things up for us. You were\na fantastic help, and I’m fantastically grateful!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "After this, I think I’ll spend some time researching\nwhich Poison-type moves Aron find the tastiest.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t you worry, my little Aron friends! I’ll keep\nfeeding you as much scrap metal as you like.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
